  },
  "section": "3.309",
  "rulesText": "Prerequisite: Level 5+ Warlock\n\nYou can breathe underwater, and you gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.\n\nYou can also cast Water Breathing once without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to cast it in this way again when you finish a Long Rest."
}
